        "summary": "Accept deletion for the verified account",
        "description": "The verified access-token subject is the only target; no accountId, email or phone field is accepted. Require signed auth_time within 300 seconds, with the existing 60-second future-clock tolerance and iat >= auth_time. Refreshing an access token is not reauthentication. A retry for the same account and operationId refers to the fixed command; never generate a replacement ID after a timeout or lost acknowledgement. Acceptance is asynchronous and does not prove backup erasure or identity finalization. Export before requesting deletion; acceptance invalidates unfinished account exports. No paid/provider/allowance dependency. No device-binding header is required by this route.",
